OL,3,GNEWSARoadworks postponed after safety
OL,4,Aconcerns raised
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe next phase of roadworks replacing
OL,7,Fold gas pipes has been postponed due to
OL,8,Fsafety concerns.
OL,10,FTorbay Council said the project on
OL,11,FDartmouth Road in Galmpton, Devon, had
OL,12,Fbeen revised after issues were
OL,13,Fhighlighted with traffic management and
OL,14,Fpedestrian access between Greenway Road
OL,15,Fand Manor Vale Road.
OL,17,FIt said an agreement had been reached
OL,18,Fwith Wales & West Utilities to leave
OL,19,Fthe site last Friday following the
OL,20,Fcompletion of the project's first
OL,21,Fphase.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
