OL,3,GNEWSARoadworks postponed after safety
OL,4,Aconcerns raised
OL,5,
OL,6,FContractors from Wales & West are now
OL,7,Fset to carry out the second phase of
OL,8,Fwork during school half-term, between
OL,9,F23 October and 1 November.
